{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧的大号白色文字。字号最大、亮度和对比度最高，位置也最靠前，明显是第一视觉入口；右上角目录和下方金色音符动画是次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他没藏住自己的喜欢，被对方看出来了。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定。第一眼能感受到一些犹豫，但还不能明确判断他此刻的核心感受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"被看出来之后的空落感、怕对方嫌自己太黏的焦虑、不知道如何相处，以及亲近感突然隔了一层的变化；幸福是否真实和最后终于松一口气的转折也不容易第一眼拿到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里包含多个时间阶段和好几层意思。\",\n    \"要读到后半段，才能明确拿到核心感受及其与喜欢被看出来这一处境的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "992994a8-f572-413f-afe0-fee272971040", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014356668096Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:44:19.320801+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18d15f4a56fd32e1f581a224ca1f0684a07a99d4eff6d8aef49889b24bf3c1f0", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at